// M7c scenario: the M5 defence at first light in dense fog. Fog hurts thermal imagers almost as
// much as optics, so the fight opens at a few hundred metres.
(
    id: "m7c-fog-at-dawn",
    name: "FOG AT DAWN",
    date: (1990, 10, 20),
    start_time_s: 23400, // 06:30
